                             The Immortal Struggle
                 Questions Data File for Unregistered Version

     The  following  file  are  the  questions  used  by the game for all Level
climbing  commands,  CLIMB,  CRAWL, and LEAP.  Questions can have any printable
characters  but  may not be longer than 76 characters.  Answers must be capital
letters (alphabetic only) and may not be longer than 39 characters.  The format
for a question is a line of three minus signs ("---"), the question on the next
line, and then the answer on the next line, and so on.  Answers should not have
"A" or "THE" prepended, and names should be in the format "FIRSTNAME LASTNAME".
Please  avoid  ambiguous  questions.   Ensure that questions are in the correct
format before moving them to this file!

